Package: db-barrel
Version: 2.0.0
Section: database
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Maintainer: robotelu <robotelu@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: DB Barrel 2.0 — Database Schema Introspection Tool
 A web-based database introspection tool that connects to PostgreSQL,
 MySQL, MariaDB, and SQLite databases and displays interactive visual
 schema diagrams. Configure your databases in /etc/db-barrel/databases.json
 and access the UI at http://localhost:8080.
Homepage: https://github.com/robotelu/db_barrel_2.0
